<section class="c-prime-hp-05">
  <div class="c-prime-hp-05__inner">
    <h2 class="c-prime-hp-05__heading">What Parents Are <em>Saying</em></h2>
  </div>

  <div class="c-prime-hp-05__carousel">
    <div class="c-prime-hp-05__viewport">
      <div class="c-prime-hp-05__track">

        <article class="c-prime-hp-05__card">
          <div class="c-prime-hp-05__stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="c-prime-hp-05__text">"My 9-year-old asked me 'Mom, why do we have two eyes instead of one?' I didn't know the answer. He went straight to this book, found it, and spent 45 minutes reading about vision, brains and evolution. He came back and explained it to me. I almost cried. His teacher called two weeks later to say he was the most engaged student in class."</p>
          <div class="c-prime-hp-05__author">
            <img class="c-prime-hp-05__avatar" src="https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=47" alt="Rachel M." loading="lazy" width="42" height="42">
            <div class="c-prime-hp-05__author-info">
              <span class="c-prime-hp-05__name">Rachel M.</span>
              <span class="c-prime-hp-05__meta">Mom of two · Texas · <span class="c-prime-hp-05__verified">✔ Verified buyer</span></span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="c-prime-hp-05__card">
          <div class="c-prime-hp-05__stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="c-prime-hp-05__text">"I was skeptical. My son doesn't read. He's a screen kid. I put this on the coffee table and didn't say a word. Day 3, I found him on the floor reading about black holes at 9pm when I thought he was asleep. He's read it cover to cover twice. That is not a normal thing for him. Buy it — it competes with screens and wins."</p>
          <div class="c-prime-hp-05__author">
            <img class="c-prime-hp-05__avatar" src="https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=12" alt="David K." loading="lazy" width="42" height="42">
            <div class="c-prime-hp-05__author-info">
              <span class="c-prime-hp-05__name">David K.</span>
              <span class="c-prime-hp-05__meta">Father of one · California · <span class="c-prime-hp-05__verified">✔ Verified buyer</span></span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="c-prime-hp-05__card">
          <div class="c-prime-hp-05__stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="c-prime-hp-05__text">"My daughter has never once picked up a book without being forced. I left this on the coffee table on a Friday. By Sunday she had read half of it and was explaining to her grandfather why the moon doesn't fall out of the sky. He's a retired engineer. He was impressed. I was speechless. This book is something else entirely."</p>
          <div class="c-prime-hp-05__author">
            <img class="c-prime-hp-05__avatar" src="https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=25" alt="Lisa W." loading="lazy" width="42" height="42">
            <div class="c-prime-hp-05__author-info">
              <span class="c-prime-hp-05__name">Lisa W.</span>
              <span class="c-prime-hp-05__meta">Mom of two · Ohio · <span class="c-prime-hp-05__verified">✔ Verified buyer</span></span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
